	<p>After finalizing the moving cost and services, the packers and movers in Kolkata will start the packing process with a systematic room-by-room approach:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Preparation:</strong> Before packing begins, make sure to clear out any unnecessary items, donate, sell, or discard items as per your preferences.</li>
		<li><strong>Electronics and Furniture:</strong> Pack electronics and furniture separately to ensure safe transportation. Label these boxes clearly, indicating the room they belong to.</li>
		<li><strong>Fragile Items:</strong> Wrap fragile items, such as glassware, mirrors, and decorative pieces, using bubble wrap, newspaper, or specialized moving materials. Label these boxes as "Fragile" to ensure extra care during transportation.</li>
		<li><strong>Clothing and Linens:</strong> Pack clothing and linens in suitcases or wardrobe boxes. These boxes are designed to hold clothes without wrinkles, making it easier for you at your new home.</li>
		<li><strong>Kitchen Items:</strong> Separate kitchen items into categories, such as plates, glasses, cutlery, and utensils. Pack these items in strong cartons, labeling them accordingly.</li>
		<li><strong>Documentation and Valuables:</strong> Securely pack important documents, jewelry, and other valuable items in a separate box, clearly labeling it as "Valuables" or "Documents."</li>
